 75AS    74GE(A,P2NG):XUNDL-6          2025LI59                           202602
 75AS c  Compiled (unevaluated) dataset from 2025Li59:                          
 75AS2c  Phys Rev C 112, 034337 (2025)                                          
 75AS c  Compiled by J. Chen (FRIB, MSU), December 17, 2025                     
 75AS c  2025Li59: E=58.6 and 62.6 MeV |a beam was produced from the Separated  
 75AS2c  Sector Cyclotron at iThemba LABS, South Africa. Target was 2.85        
 75AS3c  mg/cm{+2} {+74}Ge on a 10.8 mg/cm{+2} carbon backing. |g rays were     
 75AS4c  detected with the AFRODITE array of eight Compton-suppressed Clover    
 75AS5c  HPGe detectors and two low-energy photon spectrometer (LEPS). Measured 
 75AS6c  E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin, |g|g(|q)(ADO), |g(lin pol). Deduced levels, J, |p,
 75AS7c  band structures, |g-ray multipolarities. Comparisons with theoretical  
 75AS8c  calculations.                                                          
 75AS cG E,RI$From 2025Li59                                                     
 75AS cG M$Expected R{-ADO} ratios are about 0.8 for pure dipole transitions and
 75AS2cG about 1.2 for stretched quadrupole transitions; positive POL value     
 75AS3cG indicates electric nature and negative value indicates magnetic nature 
 75AS4cG of a transition (2025Li59).                                            
 75AS cG E(X)$Newly observed transitions in 2025Li59                            
 75AS CL BAND(A)$Band based on 1573, 13/2+ level. Probably a |g vibrational     
 75AS2cL band on the band based on 303, 9/2+ level (2025Li59)                   
 75AS CL BAND(b)$Band based on 303, 9/2+ level; |a=-1/2. Configuration=|pg{-9/2}
 75AS CL BAND(B)$Band based on 303, 9/2+ level; |a=+1/2. Configuration=|pg{-9/2}
 75AS CL BAND(D)$Band based on 2525, 13/2- level.                               
 75AS2cL Configuration=|p[(p{-3/2},f{-5/2})g{-9/2}{+2}]                         
 75AS CL BAND(e)$Band based on 3/2- ground state; |a=-1/2.                      
 75AS2cL Configuration=|pp{-3/2}                                                
 75AS CL BAND(E)$Band based on 3/2- ground state; |a=+1/2.                      
 75AS2cL Configuration=|pp{-3/2}                                                
 75AS CL BAND(F)$Band based on 279, 5/2- level; |a=+1/2. Configuration=|pf{-5/2}
 75AS CL BAND(f)$Band based on 279, 5/2- level; |a=-1/2. Configuration=|pf{-5/2}
 75AS cL E$From a least-squares fit to |g-ray energies (by compiler)            
 75AS cL J$As given in 2025Li59, based on measured |g|g(DCO), |g(lin pol) and   
 75AS2cL band assignments.                                                      
